This is a timeline of events that occurred in '''2019'''.

==2019==
===January===
*As people on [[Earth]] begin to grow accustomed to the way the world is after the [[Snap]], borders are altered and people start living in other countries, establishing settlements for people who had moved around.{{Ref|TFaTWS106}}<ref>In ''[[One World, One People]]'', Lacont says "Those settlements, that happened five years ago," referring to settlements established in the post-Snap world with lowered borders. This would happen soon after the Snap in May 2018 (see [[2018]] references), but Lacont says this in July 2024 (see [[2024]] references), suggesting that this happened in May 2019. To keep the settlements as soon after the Snap as possible while still making Lacont's line true, they can be taken to have started in January 2019.</ref>

====4th====
*"{{WPS|Juice (Lizzo song)|Juice}}" by [[Lizzo]] is released.{{Ref|RealEvents}}{{Ref|E}}

====5th====
*The [[Zephyr One]] team end up on [[Krylor]], where [[James Davis]] steals a pen, thinking it is cool to own a space pen.<ref name="AoS6 Zephyr Other Travels">In ''[[Inescapable]]'', a Zephyr One team incident on Saldon is referenced. In ''[[Collision Course Part Two]]'', an incident with an ocean of lava is referenced. In ''[[Leap]]'', an incident on Krylor is referenced. In ''[[The Sign]]'', incidents on a smelly planet and on a shiny planet are referenced. All of these occurred during Zephyr One's time hunting for Fitz, before the interrogation of Trok, so between July 2, 2018 (see [[2018]] references) and June 25, 2019 (see other references). They would all, therefore, be approximated to around December 29, 2018. Pushing the events apart, separating them by a week and using the order of mention as a guess, we would have Saldon around December 15, 2018, lava around December 22, 2018, Krylor around December 29, 2018, the smelly planet around January 5, 2019, and the shiny planet around January 12, 2019.<br>However, their incident on Trinawa is dated to December 29, 2018, so Krylor, the smelly planet, and the shiny planet may be pushed a further week, with January 5, 2019 for Krylor, January 12, 2019 for the smelly planet, and January 19, 2019 for the shiny planet.</ref>{{Ref|AoS610}}

====12th====
