====19th====
*The [[Zephyr One]] team have a bad encounter on a shiny planet.<ref name="AoS6 Zephyr Other Travels"/>{{Ref|AoS612}}

===February===
*[[T'Challa II]] is born to [[Nakia]]. His birth is kept a secret from the people of [[Wakanda]], and he is raised by his mother in [[Haiti]] under the name Toussaint.{{Ref|BPWF}}<ref>In ''[[Black Panther: Wakanda Forever]]'', Nakia is revealed to have been pregnant with T'Challa's son when T'Challa died in the Snap on the reasoned date May 31, 2018 (see [[2018]] references), which was kept secret from Wakanda. The movie is set in May 2025 (see [[2025]] references), although T'Challa II is listed in the [https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Hoe6eD2lTGNCxMbGc6BvEh_VhhJW5RN8/view script] for the movie as being "7" years old. It therefore best for T'Challa II to be as close to seven years old as possible, while still being six years old. Nakia says that she and T'Challa talked about raising their son in secret, so the latest Nakia can discover she is pregnant is May 30, 2018. The earliest one can discover they are pregnant is [https://health.clevelandclinic.org/how-early-can-you-tell-if-you-are-pregnant/ ten days], so it can be taken that T'Challa was born nine months after May, approximately February 2019. For Nakia's pregnancy to be kept secret, she would not be able to have left more than three months into her pregnancy. To allow her to leave as late as possible to best satisfy Ramonda's claim that it has been "six years" since she left, it can be taken that she left three months later, September 2018. This allows her to have left six years prior to May 2025.</ref>

====4th====
*[[Melinda May]] begins aiding [[S.H.I.E.L.D.]] Director [[Alphonso Mackenzie]] as his right hand.<ref>In ''[[Missing Pieces]]'', on July 2, 2019 (see other references), Mackenzie says, "May was my right hand these last few months." This would most likely refer to some point between November 2018 and April 2019. A calculation would suggest approximately February 4, 2019 as when May began helping him.</ref>{{Ref|AoS610}}

====15th====
*[[Leo Fitz]] is found on [[Sivos]] by the ''[[Lazy Comet]]'' crew, and uses an [[Iriscope]] to pretend to be [[Sivians|Sivian]], boarding the ship, with [[Enoch]] stowing away to help him.<ref>In ''[[Fear and Loathing on the Planet of Kitson]]'', it is said that Enoch and Fitz encountered "the MazTats", and in ''[[Window of Opportunity]]'', it is mentioned that they were found on Sivos. The MazTats incident must come first, with the Sivos incident leading to them being on the ''Lazy Comet''. These two events would have occurred after their cabin pressure failure on June 1, 2018 (see other references) and when Fitz is shown on the ''Lazy Comet'' by June 26, 2019 (see other references). Distributing the events evenly, the MazTats would be around October 9, 2018 and Sivos around February 15, 2019.</ref>{{Ref|AoS602}}

